{"id":"90633a8ae86ce3c4f896a1eeb76fc1c5d1e7c976","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1241914","title":"gemini 反重力的额度根本用不完啊，并且效果还不错","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"FawkesV","excerpt":"Google Gemini - @FawkesV - 上次看到 v2 有人说 Gemini 3.8 flash 的效果还不错， 就去闲鱼搞了个 18 个月的， 效果是真的不错主要是用来思考方案， 反正用子代理验证审核， 出来的效果基本上是满意的","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n    \n    <div><div><p><a href=\"/member/FawkesV\"><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b79c/a024/520829_large.png?m=1789438710\" alt=\"FawkesV\" data-uid=\"520829\"></a></p><div><p><span>1.23</span><img src=\"/static/img/diamond-blue.png?r=2\" height=\"16\" alt=\"D\"></p></div></div>\n    \n    \n    \n     &#160; <p><small><a href=\"/member/FawkesV\">FawkesV</a> · <span title=\"2026-09-14 16:19:25 +08:00\">23h 57m ago</span> · 785 views</small>\n    </p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div><p>上次看到 v2 有人说 Gemini 3.8 flash 的效果还不错， 就去闲鱼搞了个 18 个月的， 效果是真的不错</p><p>主要是用来思考方案， 反正用子代理验证审核， 出来的效果基本上是满意的 ， 并且速度也很快。 </p><p>对于我的场景，独立模块方案实施详设这些都没问题，评审代码方案也挺不错。</p><p>我用起来没感觉和 DeepSeek V4.1 flash 有什么区别， 甚至我感觉还要好一点</p><p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/c2lbcUx.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/c2lbcUx.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a></p></div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/Gemini\"><li></li> Gemini</a><a href=\"/tag/AI\"><li></li> AI</a><a href=\"/tag/方案\"><li></li> 方案</a></P><p><span>14 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-15 06:33:02 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18083644\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b6a1/2393/233073_normal.png?m=1572831959\" alt=\"heyjei\" data-uid=\"233073\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/heyjei\">heyjei</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 16:32:42 +08:00\">23h 43m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你这个进度条是剩这么多，还是已经用了这么多？之前用 gemini 3.1 pro ，根本没法用啊，一下子就用完了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18083669\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e4b42ff48cb2a2c3e5e22ff67fb9abcd?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"dnfQzjPBXtWmML\" data-uid=\"619763\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/dnfQzjPBXtWmML\">dnfQzjPBXtWmML</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 16:36:12 +08:00\">23h 40m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我刚刚狠狠的骂了 gemini ，因为他自己改错了代码，报语法错误，然后自己偷偷 git checkout 了文件，结果把我手写的更改都弄没了。<br>虽然最后找回了代码，但谁知道 gemini 偷偷给我回退过多少代码……</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18083744\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/cbdc2d2abea269348d232f9f265e7072?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yuewolf\" data-uid=\"75037\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yuewolf\">yuewolf</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-14 16:46:52 +08:00\">23h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>大佬，咸鱼搜的关键词是什么？对方直接给一个成品号码吗，还是需要给他提供 GMAIL 账号密码？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n     